OL,3,GNEWSAWirral buses are reliable and     
OL,4,Apunctual, mayor says                   
OL,6,FWirral's buses are "punctual and       
OL,7,Freliable", Liverpool City Region's     
OL,8,Fmayor has said, despite complaints from
OL,9,Fpassengers of delays and cancellations 
OL,10,Fafter they were brought into public    
OL,11,Fcontrol.                               
OL,13,FIt is one month since the buses in     
OL,14,FWirral had routes and time tables set  
OL,15,Fby the combined authority rather than  
OL,16,Fprivate companies.                     
OL,18,FPassengers have reported "teething     
OL,19,Fproblems" on the network since the     
OL,20,Flaunch, such as buses running late or  
OL,21,Fnot turning up at all.                 
