OL,3,GNEWSAWirral buses are reliable and     
OL,4,Apunctual, mayor says                   
OL,6,FMetro Mayor Steve Rotheram said the    
OL,7,Fconcerns were being listened to and    
OL,8,Froutes "tweaked" including the         
OL,9,Fpotential to add extra services, but   
OL,10,F"reliability is now 95%".              
